# Generated panels — ~350 MB for three instruments, rebuildable in ~90s from the
# M1 cache with `python vumanchuLab/panel.py`. Not artifacts to version.
data/
__pycache__/

# ...EXCEPT the frozen artifacts the LIVE side reads. These are SHIPPED, not
# generated at run time — server.js reads them to answer /api/vumanchu/*, so if
# they are not in the repo Railway boots without them and the features fail
# silently (a missing table just means "no read"/"no fan", never an error).
# This is the learn-offline / ship-a-file contract, PYTHON_LEGO.md §3.
#
# ANY new frozen artifact must be added here too. The wt_projection file was
# added and NOT listed, so it never shipped and the fan silently never drew.
!data/
data/*
!data/vumanchu_state_table.json
!data/vumanchu_wt_projection.json
